  "about": "Every shipped mobile binary and the runtime version baked into it (#1427). The OTA build refuses an update that matches none. Append one entry per store build when it ships: android `unzip -p <aab|apk> base/assets/fingerprint` (APK: assets/fingerprint), ios `Payload/Pollis.app/EXUpdates.bundle/fingerprint` in the IPA. `nativeIdenticalTo` (#1446): this binary's baked value is stray (build-time pollution, #1429) but its native code is identical to the build of the same platform and commit carrying that runtime version; every update for that runtime version is also published, re-signed, under this one. Runbook: mobile/CLAUDE.md -> OTA updates.",
